    "description": {
      "content": "Representative OpenAPI description of the public GameAnalytics REST surfaces: the Collection (Collector) API for HMAC-signed event ingestion, the Metrics API for aggregated reporting, and the Organization API for programmatic administration of games, studios, users, and permissions. Endpoints and authentication reflect the public GameAnalytics documentation; consult the docs for the full request/response payloads, which are large and evolving.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: GameAnalytics Support",
